      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠳᠠᠭᠣᠷᠢᠰᠬᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>daγurisqaqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>дуурьсгах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>DAΓURISXA-</transcript>
      <definition>v. caus. of daγuris-;</definition>
      <page>220</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠠᠶᠠᠷ ᠢ ᠳᠠᠭᠣᠷᠢᠰᠬᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>bajar i --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To express one's joy; to congratulate.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠡᠷ ᠎ᠲᠦ ᠺᠡᠯᠡᠭᠰᠡᠨ ᠦᠭᠡ ᠢ ᠭᠠᠳᠠᠭᠰᠢ ᠪᠢᠲᠡᠭᠡᠢ ᠳᠠᠭᠣᠷᠢᠰᠬᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>ger ty kelegsen yge i γadaγsi bitegei --!</transcript>
          <definition> Do not spread outside what is said at home.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
    <entry_item>
      <dico>Kowalewski</dico>
      <unicode>ᠳᠠᠭᠣᠷᠢᠰᠬᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
      <definition>rendre le son, résonner, vibrer, 2 répandre, divulguer , déclarer: 3 louer, célébrer, glorifier</definition>
      <page>1591</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠢᠷᠡᠭᠰᠡᠨ ᠰᠠᠶᠢᠨ ᠺᠡᠮᠡᠨ ᠪᠠᠶᠠᠷ ᠢ ᠳᠠᠭᠣᠷᠢᠰᠬᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <definition>(montrer la joie) complimenter sur le retour</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠦᠨᠡᠭᠡᠨ ᠠᠷᠰᠠᠯᠠᠨ ᠤ ᠳᠠᠭᠤᠨ ᠢ ᠳᠠᠭᠣᠷᠢᠰᠬᠭᠰᠠᠨ ᠦᠯᠦ ᠴᠢᠳᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <definition>le renard ne peut pas rugir comme le lion</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠯᠤᠤ ᠳᠠᠭᠤᠨ ᠢᠶᠠᠷ ᠳᠠᠭᠣᠷᠢᠰᠬᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <definition>crier comme un dragon</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>0 ᠡᠳᠦᠦ ᠺᠢᠺᠡᠳ ᠫᠠᢐ ᠤᠨ ᠳᠠᠭᠤᠨ ᠢ ᠳᠠᠭᠣᠷᠢᠰᠬᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <definition>prononcer les sons hûm et pad</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
